exports[`first-run onboarding on the stead > chooses the bare host with its limitation and the one install step when the node serves no workshops > 3 workshop, bare host 1`] = `
"a creature for C:/src/stead
  name █
  skin █
> workshop
  models
[portrait kid]
Where its commands run.
  a sealed sandbox needs Docker Sandboxes installed first (on Windows: winget install -h Docker.sbx) · you can move it into one later from its workshop
> █ directly on this computer
    no sandbox is available here yet (this host serves no workshops) · its commands run directly on this computer
j k move · enter keeps · i opens a terminal to install it · a keeps the suggestions for the rest · backspace goes back · esc not now"
`;

